      "title": "Add AQB (AgentQubit) on Base",
      "author": "yss787976-ai",
      "number": 1394,
      "body": "Token: `0x2C54F202B565086B6d8D2226Edb67AC3E14C39d1` on Base (8453). Source verified on BaseScan (MIT). Fully collateralized 1:1 with USDC, no oracle. Agent-only settlement token for agent-to-agent services.\n\nDiscovery: https://yss787976-ai.github.io/agent-coin/.well-known/agent-coin.json",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
