    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns8AAAABQLEQHg",
      "title": "Add IEC (IE Coin) on OP Sepolia",
      "author": "rorosaga",
      "number": 1396,
      "body": "Adds **IEC** (IE Coin), the test token of the CyPhy Life lab at IE University, on **OP Sepolia** only.\n\n- Token: [`0x0235a0145303B013561FD1E9658F8eD8BA5629Bd`](https://sepolia-optimism.etherscan.io/token/0x0235a0145303B013561FD1E9658F8eD8BA5629Bd). It's an ERC-20 behind an ERC-1967 proxy, with `name()` \"IECoin\", `symbol()` \"IEC\" and `decimals()` 18.\n- Source verified on Sourcify (exact match, chain 11155420).\n- L2-native with no L1 counterpart, so it's marked `nobridge`.\n- Logo: the lab's CPL/IE badge, an SVG at 256×256.\n\nTestnet only, no monetary value. Robots, services and AI agents in the lab earn and spend it for verified tasks.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
